{"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_084BB0","resource_class":"BRIEFING_NBE","status":"TRANSLATED_PENDING_CSV_MERGE","translations":[{"unique_index":0,"cn_text":"Mother Base每个月都会把当月过生日的士兵聚起来，办一场生日会。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":86,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":1,"cn_text":"一群战士办生日派对也挺不搭调，不过说到底，好像只是找个名目喝酒闹腾。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":102,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":2,"cn_text":"对海上要塞来说，连弄到酒都不是件容易的事。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":63,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":3,"cn_text":"再加上他们平日整天忙着训练，似乎很难随心所欲地喝酒。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":78,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":4,"cn_text":"所以听说Snake和Miller决定每月办一次这种派对，让士兵们放松一下。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":89,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":5,"cn_text":"当然，毕竟是一群粗犷战士的生日会，不会搞什么吹蛋糕蜡烛之类装模作样的仪式。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":111,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":6,"cn_text":"烟雾缭绕中，他们喝酒吃肉。低俗笑话和拿彼此出身开涮的侮辱性称呼满天飞。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":105,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":7,"cn_text":"不过好像很少真的打起来。嘴上说得再难听，大家看起来都很享受这个派对。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":102,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":8,"cn_text":"真奇怪。有的人以前是<R=FSLN,SANDINISTA>，有的人属于UCLA，明明过去应该是敌人。","cn_control_tokens":"[\"<R=FSLN,SANDINISTA>\"]","cn_utf8_bytes":104,"review_flag":"RUBY_READING_ROMANIZED"},{"unique_index":9,"cn_text":"这也是那个男人——<R=BIG BOSS,BIG BOSS>——靠个人威望造就的<R=成果,WAZA>吗？","cn_control_tokens":"[\"<R=BIG BOSS,BIG BOSS>\", \"<R=成果,WAZA>\"]","cn_utf8_bytes":99,"review_flag":"RUBY_READING_ROMANIZED"},{"unique_index":10,"cn_text":"还是说，抛弃国家后，他们连对其他国家的憎恨也一起丢掉了？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":84,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":11,"cn_text":"Miller还顾虑我，说什么“都是些粗俗的家伙，抱歉啊”，可没过多久，他自己似乎也喝醉了。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":123,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":12,"cn_text":"他大喊“看看真正的我！”然后脱下裤子，把屁股露给所有人看。其他士兵也笑成一片。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":117,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":13,"cn_text":"真是个蠢透了的派对。可是……","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":42,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":14,"cn_text":"像这样做着无聊的事、一起大笑，难道这就是所谓的和平吗？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":81,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":15,"cn_text":"不知为什么，我开始一件件回想来到这里之后发生的事。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":75,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":16,"cn_text":"和Chico他们一起钓鱼，和Amanda、Cécile一起做饭，和大家踢足球，还有感冒时来探望我的那些人……","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":129,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":17,"cn_text":"现在想来，来到这里之后的这段日子，也许是我一生中最和平的时候。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":93,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":18,"cn_text":"可这一切也马上要结束了。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":36,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":19,"cn_text":"他应该不会接受谈判。我将不得不和那个<R=BIG BOSS,BIG BOSS>本人交手。","cn_control_tokens":"[\"<R=BIG BOSS,BIG BOSS>\"]","cn_utf8_bytes":90,"review_flag":"RUBY_READING_ROMANIZED"},{"unique_index":20,"cn_text":"我不知道自己能不能赢过<R=BIG BOSS,BIG BOSS>，但违抗<R=CIPHER,CIPHER>比死亡更加可怕。","cn_control_tokens":"[\"<R=BIG BOSS,BIG BOSS>\", \"<R=CIPHER,CIPHER>\"]","cn_utf8_bytes":107,"review_flag":"RUBY_READING_ROMANIZED"},{"unique_index":21,"cn_text":"仅仅是死，我并不害怕。可一旦违抗命令，我恐怕会尝到比死亡更深的恐惧与绝望。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":111,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":22,"cn_text":"而且，给身为孤儿的我住处和食物的人，正是<R=CIPHER,CIPHER>。他的命令虽然总是蛮不讲理，但我并没有忘记这份恩情。","cn_control_tokens":"[\"<R=CIPHER,CIPHER>\"]","cn_utf8_bytes":155,"review_flag":"RUBY_READING_ROMANIZED"},{"unique_index":23,"cn_text":"到头来，我还是只能和那个男人战斗吧。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":54,"review_flag":""}]}